y to the triggering roll.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!cZjaQr02hskqXH1U.S7zsUkdZKXOhb4jT"},{"_id":"OsTExLtsjB0OOmeN","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","name":"Caustic Mucus","sort":400000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>Ahrkinos spits a ball of caustic mucus up to a range of 50 feet that explodes in a @Template[burst|distance:10]. Creatures within the burst take @Damage[5d6[acid]|options:area-damage] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:20|basic|options:area-effect] save). Those that fail this save also take @Damage[1d6[persistent,acid]] damage and take a –5-foot status penalty to their Speed. This Speed reduction ends with the persistent acid damage.</p>\n<p>Ahrkinos can't use Caustic Mucus again for [[/gmr 1d6 #Recharge Caustic Mucus]]{1d6 rounds}.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["acid","arcane"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!cZjaQr02hskqXH1U.OsTExLtsjB0OOmeN"},{"_id":"FyIAK0FbxvvCk4pq","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","name":"Draconic Frenzy","sort":500000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>Ahrkinos makes one fangs Strike and two tail Strikes in any order.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},